      "text": "After breakfast, take a sightseeing tour of Uruguay’s capital.\n\nThe tour includes Independence Square, with its statue of national hero José Gervasio Artigas, Constitution Square and the Metropolitan Cathedral, whose foundation stone was laid in 1740.\n\nMontevideo’s streetscape combines features of different European cities with Art Nouveau architecture. After seven busy days on the road, you have the afternoon free to explore the capital at your own pace.\n\nAfternoon at leisure.",
